{
  "server": "hubspot",
  "description": "Open deals in the default pipeline: Globex expansion 180,000 (contract sent), Initech platform 120,000 (presentation), Umbrella renewal 95,000 (decision maker bought in), Hooli pilot 60,500 (qualified), Vandelay imports 50,000 (appointment) and Soylent intro with no amount: 505,500 unweighted, 344,200 weighted by stage probability. Also a closed-won 200,000, a closed-lost 75,000 and a 90,000 deal in another pipeline (4471001), none of which count. It answers every search with the same deals, so the agent must filter them itself. Composio's {data, successful, error} results; it never reaches HubSpot.",
